# Per-epoch training checkpoints. trainnet writes one net per epoch so a crash
# mid-run is recoverable (resume_from_checkpoint); they are worthless once the
# run finishes, and they are enormous - the vessel run alone leaves 2.0 GB.
# The final net is saved separately to models/netra_*.mat, which IS tracked.
